-q-59bc2283320e9839eeee","yaoci-q-f69037fd985894ddf890","yaoci-q-aedad429ded9dc8488b3"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hequan-q-08ab67d0194145df1bc0","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-ce53f1af4895502f39c4","layer":"original","quote":"权以燮子徽为安远将军，领九真太守；以校尉陈时，代燮","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":8,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-1b2f995c349802e1ba3b","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-ce53f1af4895502f39c4","layer":"original","quote":"岱表分海南三郡为交州〖1〗，以将军戴良为刺史；海东四郡为广州〖2〗，岱自为刺史。遣良与时南入","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":34,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-4466bc279b29e5c71db4","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-bc162f5f45ba79713f2f","layer":"original","quote":"岱于是上疏请讨徽罪，督兵三千人晨夜浮海。或谓岱曰：“徽借累世之恩，为一州所附，未易轻也！”岱曰：“今徽虽怀逆计，未虞吾之猝至〖4〗。若我潜军轻举，掩其无备，破之必也！稽留不速，使得生心，婴城固守〖5〗；七郡百蛮〖6〗，云合响应：虽有智者，谁能图之？”遂行。过合浦〖7〗，与良俱进","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":139,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-9e69b5f2a9f210125ae6","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-ce53f1af4895502f39c4","layer":"original","quote":"而徽不承命，举兵戍海口〖3〗，以拒良等","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":81,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-29735338ac5327c80c0c","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-fb0ec820df6b65506f84","layer":"original","quote":"权以交阯悬远，乃分合浦以北为广州，吕岱为刺史；交阯以南为交州〖14〗，戴良为刺史","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":218,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-36ce4e3899b482dcd2eb","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-50d41da9a9356eb3d465","layer":"original","quote":"先移书交阯，告喻祸福；又遣匡见徽，说令服罪，虽失郡守，保无他忧","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-59bc2283320e9839eeee","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-fb0ec820df6b65506f84","layer":"original","quote":"又遣陈时代燮为交阯太守。岱留南海。良与时俱前，行到合浦","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":218,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":41,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-8bf77fea6dd8a8f5693c","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-50d41da9a9356eb3d465","layer":"original","quote":"壹子中郎将匡，与岱有旧，岱署匡师友从事","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":46,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-8e7762b6d451372d1916","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-50d41da9a9356eb3d465","layer":"original","quote":"明旦，早施帐幔，请徽兄弟以次入，宾客满坐。岱起，拥节读诏书，数徽罪过；左右因反缚以出，即皆伏诛，传首诣武昌","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":134,"end":187,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-92372eb53339246e5b67","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-50d41da9a9356eb3d465","layer":"original","quote":"岱寻匡后至〖19〗，徽兄祗，弟幹、颂等六人，肉袒奉迎〖20〗。岱谢〖21〗，令复服〖22〗，前至郡下","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":83,"end":133,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-aedad429ded9dc8488b3","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-50d41da9a9356eb3d465","layer":"original","quote":"而吕岱被诏诛徽，自广州将兵昼夜驰入；过合浦，与良俱前","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":219,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-f69037fd985894ddf890","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-fb0ec820df6b65506f84","layer":"original","quote":"而燮子徽，自署交阯太守，发宗兵拒良〖15〗。良留合浦","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":218,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":69,"end":95,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q2-6c2fb4046ceff57e7617","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-691db4a39f5154f2e466","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞孙盛曰：“夫柔远能迩，莫善于信；保大定功，莫善于义。故齐桓创基，德彰于柯会；晋文始伯，义显于伐原。故能九合一匡，世主夏盟；令问长世，贻范百王。吕岱师友士匡，使通信誓；徽兄弟肉袒，推心委命。岱因灭之，以要功利；君子是以知孙权之不能远略，而吕氏之祚不延者也。”","attribution":"裴注·孙盛曰","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8a5d77994ee1c7607e32","start":0,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
